dsh-calling-card-skin bundles SIL Open Font License 1.1 families
inside lib/skin.css and lib/client.js as data URLs, and also ships the
font files under assets/fonts:

- Anton (Copyright 2020 The Anton Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-Anton.txt
- Archivo Black (Copyright 2020 The Archivo Black Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-ArchivoBlack.txt
- Abril Fatface (Copyright 2011 The Abril Fatface Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-AbrilFatface.txt
- Noto Sans SC (Regular, Bold and Black subsets as CcSans / CcHeavy) and Noto Serif SC (Copyright 2014-2024 Adobe, Reserved Font Name Source) — LICENSES/OFL-CJK.txt
- Barlow Semi Condensed SemiBold and ExtraBold, Latin subset (Copyright 2017 The Barlow Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-Barlow.txt
- ZCOOL KuaiLe (Copyright 2018 The ZCOOL KuaiLe Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-CJK.txt
- Ma Shan Zheng (Copyright 2018 The MaShanZheng Project Authors) — LICENSES/OFL-CJK.txt

The CJK files are woff2 subsets of those families, cut to GB2312 level 1
plus the skin's own labels (about 536 KB, 704 KB, 449 KB, and 1.7 MB; the
0.5.1 conversation faces CcHeavy Bold and Black are about 581 KB and 564 KB).
They cover 3,751 ideographs. A rarer character can still fall through to a generic family.

assets/star-band.svg and the calling-card geometry are original to this skin.
No game artwork, character art, or game fonts are included.

This package does not modify DeepSeek Harness, dsh-industrial-acid-skin, or
dsh-audio-reactive.
